OL,3,GNEWSACarnival organisers set up
OL,4,A'community assembly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA celebration and fundraiser has been
OL,7,Fheld in support of a street carnival
OL,8,Fcurrently on hiatus.
OL,10,FOxford's 40-year-old Cowley Road
OL,11,FCarnival has only happened once since
OL,12,Fthe Covid pandemic in 2024, with the
OL,13,Fprevious organisers stepping down
OL,14,Fearlier this year.
OL,16,FPlans are in place for it to return on
OL,17,F4 July 2027.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
