OL,3,GNEWSACarnival organisers set up
OL,4,A'community assembly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRosie Jacobs, the new chair of Cowley
OL,7,FRoad Works, the registered charity that
OL,8,Fruns it, said it was "really exciting"
OL,9,Fand "emotional" to see people attend
OL,10,Fthe so-called community assembly, which
OL,11,Fincluded panel discussions on the
OL,12,Ffuture of the event.
